### Rust ###
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Only track specific content assets in this repo. Ignore other assets or symlinks to other assets.
assets/*
!assets/examples/

# Remove Cargo.lock from gitignore if creating an executable, leave it for libraries
# More information here https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html
# Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

### rust-analyzer ###
# Can be generated by other build systems other than cargo (ex: bazelbuild/rust_rules) 
rust-project.json

# Working plans written at the repo root before a change is made. Scratch, not documentation. 
# Longer-term planning doc filed in [docs/*] can still be committed and tracked.
/*-plan.md

# Working task trackers written beside a plan. Same class of document, same rule.
/*-tasks.md
/*-todo.md

*.bak
